  "body": "Stacked on #2563 (merge #2563 first)\n\n## What changed\n\n- Added `FeatureSel::SketchChain(ChainId)` and `FeatureSel::SketchLayer(String)` in `crates/app/src/operation/types/sel.rs` and `pick/feature_sel.rs` (`FeatureSel` now derives `Clone` without `Copy`).\n- Added ray-to-curve hit testing for DXF sketch primitives in `crates/app/src/pick/sketch_pick.rs` and `pick/feature_pick.rs` with solid-body occlusion.\n- Added `ChainOverride` per-chain `side` and `reverse` overrides on `OpParams::Contour` (`PROJECT_VERSION = 73` and `examples/first-continuous-4axis-part.camproj` updated to version 73).\n- Added DXF contour planning, natural nesting vs per-chain generation, `G2`/`G3` arc preservation, and open-chain safety checks in `operation/contour_sketch.rs` and `operation/contour_sketch_pick.rs`.\n- Admitted `2D Contour` on DXF sketches in `sketch_model::generation_problem`, `operation/material.rs`, `operation/material_region.rs`, and `operation/job.rs` (`part_solid = false`).\n- Extended MCP `list_features`, `set_operation_geometry`, and `get_operation_geometry` in `mcp/features.rs` and `mcp/pick.rs`, and updated `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\n- Updated the UI for sketch chain clicks (`edge_pick.rs`), layer buttons (`geo_page.rs`), per-chain controls (`mill2d_page.rs`, `fields.rs`), chips (`state.rs`), and viewport highlights (`pick_highlight.rs`, `interact.rs`).\n\n## Cause\n\nPreviously, `sketch_model::generation_problem` refused all operations on DXF profiles. Also, `FeatureSel` had no sketch keys, and ray picking skipped sketch geometry.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pins:\n  - `crates/app/tests/contour_dxf_sketch.rs`: `whole_plate_auto_nesting_cuts_outer_outside_holes_inside_and_preserves_g2_g3_arcs`, `layer_and_chain_picks_per_chain_overrides_undo_and_project_v73_roundtrip`, `open_chain_safety_refuses_side_compensation_and_g41_by_name`\n  - `crates/app/tests/contour_dxf_sketch_verify.rs`: `ray_pick_hits_sketch_line_arc_circle_and_respects_solid_occlusion`, `move_sketch_stock_shift_unresolved_model_height_and_verify_checks`, `mcp_sketch_workflow_picks_chains_layers_sets_overrides_and_generates`\n  - `crates/ui/tests/contour_dxf_sketch.rs`: `edge_pick_handles_sketch_chain_replace_shift_append_and_ctrl_toggle`, `state_sketch_layer_pick_per_chain_override_and_generate_produces_ok_status`\n  - `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/contour_dxf_sketch.rs`: `geo_page_layer_picker_and_mill2d_per_chain_overrides_work_and_generate`\n- Mutations:\n  - `sketch_model::generation_problem`: removed the `OpParams::Contour` arm; `whole_plate_auto_nesting_cuts_outer_outside_holes_inside_and_preserves_g2_g3_arcs` failed; restored and passed.\n  - `contour_sketch::validate_plan`: bypassed the open-chain guard; `open_chain_safety_refuses_side_compensation_and_g41_by_name` failed; restored and passed.\n  - `operation/material.rs::named_material`: removed the `Sketch` arm; `whole_plate_auto_nesting_cuts_outer_outside_holes_inside_and_preserves_g2_g3_arcs` failed; restored and passed.\n  - `pick/feature_pick.rs::pick_feature`: removed the `sketch_pick::pick_sketches` call; `ray_pick_hits_sketch_line_arc_circle_and_respects_solid_occlusion` failed; restored and passed.\n- Gate and Clippy:\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` (fell back to `batch` because `crates/geometry/src/sketch_chains/mod.rs` changed): `895 step(s), 0 failed` (`76.3 min`), including `clippy -D warnings` across all 8 workspace crates (`--all-targets -- -D warnings`).\n\n## Goldens moved\n\n- None. No `.nc` or `.cl` golden file changed. (`examples/first-continuous-4axis-part.camproj` stepped from version 72 to 73 to match `PROJECT_VERSION`.)\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- We did not run visual GPU rendering of sketch highlights inside an interactive `View3D` window. Headless UI tests covered `State` and `egui_kittest::Harness` rendering.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- Stacked on PR #2563 (`base-2563`; touches `examples/first-continuous-4axis-part.camproj`, `crates/app/src/project/file.rs`, `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`, `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`, and test migrations).\n- PR #2688, PR #2678, PR #2665, PR #2662, and PR #2641 touch shared files (`operation/job.rs`, `operation/generate.rs`, `mcp/pick.rs`, `project/file.rs`, `state.rs`, `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`) in other functions or operation kinds. Whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: feat(cam): support 2D Contour on DXF sketches with layer/chain picking, per-chain side and direction overrides, and meshless verification (#1864).\n\nFixes #1864\n",
